<title>ITALY: Italy new car registrations up 21.45 pct in Feb.</title>
<headline>Italy new car registrations up 21.45 pct in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian new car registrations rose 21.45 percent to 198,000 vehicles in February this year compared with 163,031 in February 1996, the Italian transport ministry said.</p>
</text>
